//! Slice 2 review: A relation with a `resolve` policy on a same-tick cycle is BLS0503 (SEM-086).

program r4 version 1;
input put(k: u64, v: u64);
table reg(k: u64, v: u64) key(k) resolve choose_most(v);
table other(k: u64, v: u64);
w: on put(k, v) { emit other(k, v); }
a: while other(k, v) { emit reg(k, v); }
b: while reg(k, v) { emit other(k, v); }
